    { "type": "text", "id": "final_caption", "x": 20, "y": 300, "width": 1030, "height": 44,
      "text": "Any handler can stop the chain outright and return early -- unlike Decorator (Structural tab), where every wrapping\nlayer always calls through to what it wraps. Same shape (a linked sequence of handlers), different contract.",
